                    <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;Your registration will be complete once you click below. By submitting this form, you confirm that you are authorized to agree to the &lt;a href=&quot;https://info.cois.org/cis-internatonal-accreditation-terms-and-conditions&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Terms and Conditions&lt;/a&gt; of our accreditation service.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;An invoice for the one-time accreditation registration fee and an annual accreditation fee will be processed upon submission.&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
                    <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
